00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.380
But you know, yeah, again, it's just getting the feel of it takes time.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:19.460
Um, did you guys feel any connection between the enemies, you know, being robots and especially when they're up close on you and everything to Terminator the, you know, the 1984 movie with Arnold Schwarzenegger?

