00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:59.880
No. Uh, another neat thing about the game that, uh, probably I thought separated it, but is now going to be revealed that Operation Wolf ate its lunch here too.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:07.400
Uh, when you finish a stage, uh, there is a chance that you can choose which stage you want to go to next.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:14.300
Not always, but, um, you can shoot, uh, either the, uh, left or right stage.

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:20.480
