00:32:12.540 --> 00:32:13.920
I don't think it's doing,

00:32:14.380 --> 00:32:17.320
it's a very basic zapper game to me.

00:32:17.860 --> 00:32:20.680
Um, so maybe,

00:32:21.020 --> 00:32:22.880
I mean, maybe this is a case that like,

00:32:22.960 --> 00:32:25.560
Hey, the earlier you get your zapper game into nostalgia,

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:28.360
